.TH sam-jail-review 1 2026-11-25 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-review \- Mark an app\*(Aqs profile as reviewed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail review\fR [\fB\-\-seen\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mark an app\*(Aqs profile as reviewed
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-seen\fR \fI<FINGERPRINT>\fR
Confirm only the state shown: the `review_fingerprint` from `sam\-jail info` when it was shown. Refused when the app changed since (a notice, a setting, or the AppImage)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

